    "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(agent-server): add OpenAI Responses gateway by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/pull/4694\n* docs: remove stale run-eval AGENTS reference by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/pull/4918\n* ci: enable API compliance and condenser test labels by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/pull/4204\n* docs: refresh AGENTS.md guidance by @all-hands-bot in https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/pull/4888\n* docs(skills): add PR design doc guidance by @enyst in https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/pull/4921\n* feat(sdk): StreamContext mints the stream identity and closes every stream by @VascoSch92 in https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/pull/4822\n* Release v1.47.0 by @all-hands-bot in https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/pull/4942\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/compare/v1.46.0...v1.47.0",
